    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Save",
      "description" : "Creates or updates an agent tool in the system. This operation allows configuring tool details such as schema, authentication, payload, and association with an agent. If a UUID is provided, the existing tool is updated; otherwise, a new tool is created.\n\nInput Parameters:\nuuid (string): Unique identifier of the tool (used for updating an existing tool).\ntoolId (string): Identifier of the tool.\nagentId (string): Identifier of the agent associated with the tool.\nagentSchema (object/string): Schema defining the tool’s structure and expected inputs/outputs.\nstaticPayload (object/string): Static data or predefined payload for the tool.\nauthInfo (object/string): Authentication details required for the tool.\ndescription (string): Description of the tool.\nstatus (string): Status of the tool (e.g., active/inactive).\nactive (boolean): Indicates whether the tool is enabled for use.\n\nOutput Parameters:\nuuid (string): Unique identifier of the created or updated tool.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails."
    },
    "lockedByUser" : "anoop.gupta2812@gmail.com"
  },
